flowchart TD
    A[AP ticket supplied by caller] --> B[Parse rfta / DGST property]
    B --> C[Read Memory trust object]
    C --> D{Present and matching SHA-256?}
    D -- No --> E[Fetch through Remote store]
    D -- Yes --> F[Hash selected object again]
    E --> F
    F --> G{Digest equals ticket property?}
    G -- No --> X[Return false]
    G -- Yes --> H[Put into copied first store and check result]
    H --> I[Assign TrustObject options and return true]
